s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123794.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123794.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nRemoves duplicate API surface to make `Variant`/core easier to maintain, and to avoid confusion.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nFunctions like `VariantInternal::get_aabb` did the exact same as `VariantInternalAccessor<AABB>::get`, just codifying by name instead of by type.\r\n\r\n`VariantInternalAccessor` is the version that works in template contexts, and the one that is already adopted in most of the codebase.\r\n\r\n`Object *` was skipped for now because it needs special handling, and should probably be changed to `ObjData` anyway (since that's the actual held type).\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123794/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123794/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}